<section class="page-hero"><div class="container readable"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>Small by design. Practical by default.</h1><p class="lede">Lowcountry Digital Works is being established as a small digital services business focused on useful websites, applications, automation, technical problem-solving, and maintainable digital systems.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container grid grid--2"><article class="card"><h2>Lowcountry roots</h2><p>The business is based in South Carolina's Lowcountry. Local context matters, but the work is not restricted to one geography.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Clear ownership</h2><p>Company and client assets should be held in the right owner accounts with named access, documented handoff, and a practical recovery path.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Technology in proportion</h2><p>Static hosting and simple architectures are preferred when they solve the problem. More infrastructure is added only when a real requirement justifies it.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Work that can be explained</h2><p>Documentation, testing, and understandable tradeoffs are part of the deliverable rather than an afterthought.</p></article></div></section>
